    {
      "id": 119470,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-10-17T14:34:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>(This has been said before, but just so newer folks here it...)</p><p>Recommendation: Gloss varnish, then (multiple coats of) matte varnish. That way, when the matte starts wearing down, you will hit the gloss varnish and can tell it needs a new coat - instead of hitting paint and ruining the figure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wasn't there someone who recommended a floor polish or something that made the minis indestructible?</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:52:39.906Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 11419,
      "topic_slug": "anyone-have-foam-recommendations-for-the-minis",
      "display_username": "Rabit",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
