      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": true,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>(This has been said before, but just so newer folks here it...)</p><p>Recommendation: Gloss varnish, then (multiple coats of) matte varnish. That way, when the matte starts wearing down, you will hit the gloss varnish and can tell it needs a new coat - instead of hitting paint and ruining the figure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wasn&#39;t there someone who recommended a floor polish or something that made the minis indestructible?</p>",
