      "raw": "<p>I dunno about indestructible, but Future floor polish (Pledge with Future Shine now I think) is commonly used on minis. It&#39;s pretty much pure acrylic and quite strong. I use it on polymer clay and while it does scratch off if you make a proper effort to destroy it, I suspect ordinary gloss varnish will do that too. In the UK it&#39;s called Johnson&#39;s Klear, but I think the new formula doesn&#39;t really work. You want the old stuff in the clear bottle.</p><p>Lots of info about it out there on the &#39;net if you&#39;re interested.</p>",
